{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1554338-radiant-basilisc-jewel","id":1554338,"title":"Radiant Basilisc Jewel","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-10-13T04:11:08-07:00","id":1554338,"title":"Radiant Basilisc Jewel","content":"Hello! If a Lunar mimics a Hearthstone with the Dependent tag with Radiant Basilisc Jewel, does she needs to have a 2nd Hearthstone socketed in order to get the effects of the one gained from the Charm? Or do Hearthstone's tag nnot matter with that Charm?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-13T15:34:15-07:00","id":1554351,"title":"","content":"The Lunar would likely need to socket another hearthstone via its prerequisite in order to make the RBJ stone work, as the only keyword that it allows the Lunar to kind of sidestep is Linked (because the Lunar herself is the dependent geomantic focus there).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-17T10:57:37-07:00","id":1554424,"title":"","content":"Really, Dependent is the only keyword that might have relevance one way or the other, considering that all the others are just settling it one side or another on the binaries of &quot;will or won't stop working without the parent source&quot; and &quot;only comes from a manse/never comes from a manse&quot;, which are all pretty much irrelevant in the face of a hearthstone grown out of a Lunar.<br /> <br /> I wonder if the example given of a hearthstone inappropriate to the Charm would imply that as far as the writer was concerned, it wouldn't be limited so. After all, if a Gem of Incomparable Wellness could hypothetically be made permanent, that implies that there's no assumption of it requiring the presence of another hearthstone, doesn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-18T07:58:52-07:00","id":1554446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1554338-radiant-basilisc-jewel?p=1554424#post1554424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After all, if a Gem of Incomparable Wellness could hypothetically be made permanent, that implies that there's no assumption of it requiring the presence of another hearthstone, doesn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was wondering about that. If the Lunar-grown Gem of Incomparable Wellness is Dependent, it's not any more powerful than a normal GoIW, because an enemy just need to steal/destroy/neutralize the other gem that is socketed in the Lunar or her Artifact to render the GoIW useless.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-19T10:33:24-07:00","id":1554477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1554338-radiant-basilisc-jewel?p=1554446#post1554446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering about that. If the Lunar-grown Gem of Incomparable Wellness is Dependent, it's not any more powerful than a normal GoIW, because an enemy just need to steal/destroy/neutralize the other gem that is socketed in the Lunar or her Artifact to render the GoIW useless.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Still, it doesn't really feel right to try extrapolating too deeply from such an example.<br /> <br /> I suppose a decent rule of thumb would be that Dependent hearthstones are more secure than they might otherwise be in a way that makes some of them worth excluding, but otherwise still require a second hearthstone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-19T16:16:12-07:00","id":1554498,"title":"","content":"You can also avoid sudden power failure by getting a Steady stone with your merit dots and just keeping it in place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}